<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rates falls to 6.28 percent.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rates falls to 6.28 percent.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate for the Jordanian dinar fell to 6.28 percent on Tuesday from 6.61 percent, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said five banks traded on the market in 12 reported transactions, with a total value of 14.5 million dinars.</p>
<p>$1 = 0.708 dinar</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
</text>
